  fhir:ValueSet.description [ fhir:value "The nine diagnostic positions of gaze at which a strabismus measurement or\nbinocular finding is recorded: primary position, the four secondary positions (up gaze /\nsupraversion, down gaze / infraversion, right gaze / dextroversion, left gaze / levoversion)\nand the four tertiary (oblique) positions. SNOMED CT qualifier values from the Gaze\ndirections hierarchy."] ;
